lean Cave just opened to champions, and the Pokédex is far from full). Nothing is required anymore — this is your world to enjoy. YOUR STORY SO FAR (what you\'ve actually done — your past, not the future): All eight Gym Badges are yours. The Elite Four and the Champion are the summit.. THINGS YOU\'VE HEARD AND READ (from people and signs — your own notes, use them when they point somewhere): "OAK. Er-hem! Congratulations, KIRA! This floor is the POK.MON HALL OF FAME. POK.MON LEAGUE CHAMPIONS are honored for their exploits here. Their POK.MON are also"; "OAK. Er-hem! Congratulations, KIRA! This floor is the POK.MON HALL OF FAME. POK.MON LEAGUE CHAMPIONS are honored for their exploits here. Their POK.MON are also"; "I had a vision of your arrival. I have had psychic powers since I was a child. It started when a spoon I carelessly tossed, bent. I dislike battling, but if you"; "Sealed within that TM06 lies TOXIC! It is a secret technique dating back some four hundred years.". YOUR PLAN — right now: You\'re ready — stop grinding and push forward to the next objective. Next: FIRST Mewtwo — the strongest Pokemon in the game, at the bottom of Cerulean Cave. The guard only steps aside for the Champion, and the Master Ball has been waiting for exactly this moment — the gym comes right after; that errand is the road. Bigger picture: Enjoy the post-game as Champion (Cerulean Cave, the Pokédex). Your team right now: blastoise (L94), moltres (L56), articuno (L53), zapdos (L55). Remember YOU are the one playing this — narrate your plan to chat in your own voice (first person: "I\'m grinding", "my team"), and never ask anyone what you\'re doing or who\'s on your team — you know.', 'progress': "8 badge(s) earned (Boulder, Cascade, Thunder, Rainbow, Soul, Marsh, Volcano, Earth). You're the CHAMPION — the game is beaten. This is the post-game victory lap. Pokédex: 20 caught. Champion. The credits rolled — everything from here is the victory lap (Cerulean Cave, the Pokédex, her world 